<title>POLAND: Polish average wage slips to PLN 1,100 in May.</title>
<headline>Polish average wage slips to PLN 1,100 in May.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish average wage in the enterprise sector fell to 1,100 zlotys in May from 1,107 zlotys in April, but was 17.5 percent higher than in May 1996, the Central Statistical Office said on Friday.</p>
<p> POLISH AVERAGE WAGES	  MAY	 APRIL	MAY 1996</p>
<p> average mthly wage PLN     1,100	1,107	  936</p>
